{{!
    @template local_awareness/manage/resultcount

    The row count printed above the notice table.

    Rendered server-side rather than assembled in JavaScript from a data attribute: the count and
    its sentence are decided in one place, so there is no window in which the two disagree.

    Context variables required:
    * count (string) — the already-formatted number of matching notices

    Example context (json):
    {
        "count": "25"
    }
}}
<p class="local-awareness-resultcount" aria-live="polite">
    {{#str}}manage:resultcount, local_awareness, {{count}}{{/str}}
</p>
